      "sample_posts": [
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Micron and Meta have jointly published a white paper, and it contains some truly important insights. It’s definitely worth reading.   https:// micron.com/about/blog/mem ory/dram/when-memory-changes-the-equation …",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081243127797686457",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-26T13:00:03.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 2322
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Citi cuts Micron price target on peaking memory prices  Citi downgraded Micron, arguing that both DRAM and NAND prices will see QoQ gains decelerate over the next four quarters, with pricing peaking in the May (F2Q) quarter of next year.  Specifically, Citi revised its QoQ DRAM",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085865896090992746",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-08T07:09:17.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 2023
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Just in from The Wall Street Journal: Apple is lobbying the White House to allow the use of Chinese-made memory chips, while Micron is pushing back hard, arguing that it should never be permitted—putting the two companies at odds.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080821984385278397",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T09:06:35.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1568
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Nomura just initiated coverage on CXMT, assigning it a price target of RMB 116 and arguing that it deserves a 20x P/E multiple—twice Micron’s valuation.  That implies a 13.4x increase from the IPO price and a market capitalization of roughly RMB 7.76 trillion...  This is insane.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081508685810209276",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-27T06:35:17.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1496
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "“Sanjay has held a grudge against Apple since his days as a co-founder of SanDisk, and that resentment remains even now, in his role as Micron’s CEO.”  It’s only natural that Sanjay bristles at the mere mention of Apple.  What Apple did in 2023 was downright vicious. The days",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080829171044147401",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T09:35:08.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1495
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "According to authoritative third-party data, YMTC has already surpassed Micron and SanDisk in market share, narrowing the gap with Kioxia to just 0.4 percentage points.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080163814012842361",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-23T13:31:15.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1047
        },
        {
          "handle": "dylan522p",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "People ask me why Micron trades at a multiple to SK Hynix now that the ADR exists. It's very simple. Corporate governance exists.",
          "url": "https://x.com/dylan522p/status/2085191620048326947",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-06T10:29:57.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 966
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "美國記憶體大廠 Micron Technology（美光）宣布，已與 Qualcomm、Visteon、HARMAN、JOYNEXT、DENSO、Astemo 及 Hyundai Mobis 等七家汽車產業重要 Tier 1 供應商與生態系統夥伴，完成多項策略性客戶協議（SCAs）。  這些長期協議聚焦供應先進記憶體與儲存解決方案，支援下一代",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2077753418865942841",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-16T21:53:12.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 89
        }
      ]
