          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Citi cuts Micron price target on peaking memory prices  Citi downgraded Micron, arguing that both DRAM and NAND prices will see QoQ gains decelerate over the next four quarters, with pricing peaking in the May (F2Q) quarter of next year.  Specifically, Citi revised its QoQ DRAM",
